Rationale: The claim has two material parts: (1) St Mary's School in Pune was run for over 100 years by CSMV, and (2) CSMV was started by Reverend William John Butler. The second part is supported by evidence showing that CSMV was founded in 1848 by William John Butler. However, the first part is insufficiently evidenced—no reliable source confirms the duration or existence of CSMV's operation of St Mary's School in Pune. Further investigation is needed to confirm this part of the claim.
